            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Drake Burner",
            side: 1,
            x: 9,
            y: 51,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Drake Glider",
            side: 1,
            x: 7,
            y: 49,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Drake Glider",
            side: 1,
            x: 9,
            y: 52,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            side: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Behold, the Isle of Gaall. The most perilous hunting ground in the Domain of Vladnir. Spurred by the hunger cries of their hatchlings, many a hunter has journeyed to this place. Only to become its prey."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Our trial for aspirancy has come at last. The hunt that awaits us below will prove a worthy test."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("If only we could still count Karron among us... I fear without her aid this trial will outmatch us. We too may fall prey to this isle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Karron never was among us, verily. Her heart sought glory over our greater purpose."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("We need no further hunters to prevail here. No less of a challenge readies us for aspirancy. Neither the reascension long fortold by your caste. Call the Hunt."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("By your will— Hunters, descend! For the sake of our hatchlings, take all the prey you can carry!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_29",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Behold the many healing oases which dot this isle. Their cleansing waters purge miasma from wounds. While the tailleaf growing at their shores makes a fine poultice."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Any of us injured during the hunt should seek an oasis for healing."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_30",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2235%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2243%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_5",
            type: "Drake Fighter",
            side: 1,
            x: 34,
            y: 42,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ah, it is you, Gorlack. In my fire for the hunt, I strayed from Karron’s pack. Then a bite from venomous prey drove my retreat here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("The waters flowing from the Cenotaph of Kotick have purged the venom from my wound. I ask sanction to join your hunt, so I might now purge the dishonor of my folly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("It was <i>Karron</i> that dishonored herself by not regathering you. My sanction is given."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_31",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2228%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2216%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Karron",
            type: "Drake Warrior",
            side: 1,
            x: 27,
            y: 15,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Karron",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("So it is, that timid Gorlack attempts the Trial of Gaall."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("So it is, that brave Karron cowers within the Cenotaph of Morogor."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Karron, you are without companions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("One was slain. The other went astray."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("To attempt this trial with only two allies was unwise."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Yet so have I already succeeded, <i>little glider</i>. All my prey-tokens are gathered; my hunt is ended."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Then take your leave."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("As you wish."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("...... Karron, hold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("... It is perilous to depart from this place unaided. For your own sake, join us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Gorlack, it is purely for <b>your</b> sakes that I shall do so. One final time. When this isle is behind us, we part again as foes. You will taste humiliation at the contention. I shall deliver it."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_32",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2234%22%2C%22y%22%3A%229%22%2C%22radius%22%3A%222%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_6",
            type: "Fire Guardian",
            side: 7,
            x: 33,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_6",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("(<i>Crackle</i>)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Magnificent."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("That is a Teller. Perhaps the only beings elder than our Spoken Memories. In the Time of Beginning, they were great as stormclouds. Luminous as the skyfire of the same."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("<span size='5000' font-style='italic'>_ Ward thyselves for it has arrived. The grey light that shades the living worlds. The calm wind that snuffs warm souls. The Faerie reached this world.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("It whispers..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Before the world grew cold, the Tellers spoke to us our first Memories. Some of their wisdom, shared to us. Yet now they can only whisper, too softly to be heard. The final words they spoke aloud... “ Ward thyselves. The Faerie reached this world. ”"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Fire%20Guardian%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("There has never been time enough to waste on these glider myths. Yet you do so during <i>the hunt</i>. Gorlack, you have grown so very weak to this folly of Resha’s."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_33",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Karron%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Karron",
            text: _("Curse these nipping beasts! Gorlack, the rest are in your keeping; I must withdraw."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Karron",
            x: 64,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Karron",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_34",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Victory is yours, <b>Aspirant</b> Gorlack."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Learn from this trial, Resha. Your doubt voiced at the onset of this hunt; see now its futility."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Your Windpath was well chosen. I was wrong to doubt your fearless heart, to which I owe my life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("Gorlack... though you have forbade it, I must speak of <i>the cave</i>. My life–debt to you must be—"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Nay! There is nothing more to be said of that place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("You know what lies ahead. Henceforth, we must look only to the future."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Karron",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
